{"language_code":"spa","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Y la tercera carta es el ocho de oros. Un artesano en su banco de trabajo, tallando monedas una a una, con paciencia, sin prisa y sin distraerse. Esta carta es la respuesta a eso que llevas tiempo dándole vueltas. No se resuelve de golpe ni con un golpe de suerte. Se resuelve con constancia. Aprender algo, practicarlo un poquito cada día, mejorar despacio. Si hay un proyecto o un oficio que te ronda la cabeza, esta carta te dice que tienes la capacidad, pero que la clave está en el trabajo de cada día, no en esperar a sentir la inspiración perfecta","words":[{"text":"Y","start":0.06,"end":0.12,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00004184158387943171},{"text":" ","start":0.12,"end":0.16,"type":"spacing","logprob":-9.536738616588991e-7},{"text":"la","start":0.16,"end":0.22,"type":"word","logprob":-9.536738616588991e-7},{"text":" ","start":0.22,"end":0.28,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000512111175339669},{"text":"tercera","start":0.28,"end":0.64,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000512111175339669},{"text":" ","start":0.64,"end":0.74,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000025033637939486653},{"text":"carta","start":0.74,"end":1.06,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000025033637939486653},{"text":" ","start":1.06,"end":1.42,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00021765247220173478},{"text":"es","start":1.42,"end":1.6,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00021765247220173478},{"text":" ","start":1.6,"end":1.64,"type":"spacing","logprob":-5.8412379075889476e-6},{"text":"el","start":1.64,"end":1.74,"type":"word","logprob":-5.8412379075889476e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.74,"end":1.78,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.2016458511352539},{"text":"ocho","start":1.78,"end":2.0,"type":"word","logprob":-0.2016458511352539},{"text":" ","start":2.0,"end":2.06,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"de","start":2.06,"end":2.14,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":2.14,"end":2.2,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.015067807398736477},{"text":"oros.","start":2.2,"end":2.56,